msgid "Browse projects"
msgstr "Projekte ansehen"

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "Mitwirkende"

msgid ""
"A check on your pull request links here. Sign in with GitHub, read the "
"agreement and accept it. You sign each version of an agreement once, for all "
"repositories that ask for it."
msgstr ""
"Eine Prüfung an deinem Pull Request verlinkt hierher. Melde dich mit GitHub "
"an, lies die Vereinbarung und nimm sie an. Du unterschreibst jede Version "
"einer Vereinbarung einmal, für alle Repositories, die sie verlangen."

msgid "Maintainers"
msgstr "Maintainer"

msgid ""
"Add a configuration file to your repository, install the GitHub App and add "
"the repository. Pull requests are labelled when their authors signed."
msgstr ""
"Füge deinem Repository eine Konfigurationsdatei hinzu, installiere die "
"GitHub App und füge das Repository hinzu. Pull Requests bekommen Labels, "
"wenn ihre Autoren unterschrieben haben."

msgid "The GitHub App is installed"
msgstr "Die GitHub App ist installiert"

msgid ""
"Nothing else is needed: every repository you chose that has the file "
"<code>.github/agreements.yml</code> on its default branch is set up now, and "
"its open pull requests are checked. A repository without the file is set up "
"when the file is pushed."
msgstr ""
